  "message": "The strongest sign-up offer I found is the Rho-Bank EcoCard: spend $5,000 in eligible purchases within your first month to earn 2,000 sustainability points. The points are worth $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or deposited into a Rho-Bank checking account. The card has a $50 annual fee, a 19.99% purchase APR, and a 1% foreign transaction fee.\n\nI wasn’t able to find documented current sign-up bonuses for the other Rho-Bank cards, so I can’t reliably claim that the EcoCard is the best across every available offer. Also, because the spending window is only one month, it’s worthwhile only if $5,000 is realistic without carrying a balance. The EcoCard earns 5 points per dollar on eligible green purchases and 1 point per dollar on other purchases."
}
